The bug occurs because the check for whether the bus is full (`qbus_is_full(bus)`) is performed immediately after resolving the first element of the device path. This check is only valid if the first element is also the last one in the path, leading to incorrect behavior where devices can be plugged into full buses or fail to connect to available buses.

